# Branch groups: amenability, free subgroups, growth (Kourovka Notebook Problem 15.14)

Kourovka Notebook, Problem 15.14 (L. Bartholdi, R. I. Grigorchuk, Z. Šunić): do there exist finitely
generated branch groups (see 15.12) (a) that are non-amenable, (b) that are non-amenable and do not
contain the free group `F₂`, (c) that contain `F₂`, (d) that have exponential growth? Parts (a),
(c), (d) are in the Archive of Solved Problems; part (b) is marked solved in the main list.
-/

module

public import Batteries.Util.ProofWanted
